{"id":1749513,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-15T11:41:11.394Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1749513,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Ops Cinta Din Sardin","overview":"# Ops Cinta  The story follows Din Sardin (Izzue Islam), a notorious mat rempit in his village. After meeting Che Ta, a beautiful JPJ (Road Transport Department) officer, Din Sardin becomes increasingly interested in joining the uniformed services. His best friend Amir remains stubborn and continues illegal racing with other village mat rempits. Although Che Ta is already taken, Din's feelings for her remain unchanged. Din is determined to become a JPJ officer, not to win Che Ta's heart, but simply to be close to her and work alongside her. Initially, Din loses hope after his repeated applications to join the uniformed unit are rejected, and he returns to illegal racing. Tragedy strikes when his stubbornness leads to his best friend Amir's death in an illegal race accident. Din is determined to change and quit being a mat rempit. Che Ta helps Din by enrolling him as a volunteer in the JPJ Youth Squad awareness campaign.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/3E3PMahjVkmDOgS3BUrEvSULGqY.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2017-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Ops Cinta Din Sardin","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1276750,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Izzue Islam","original_name":"Izzue Islam","popularity":0.8708,"profile_path":"/uKfGqf7EPImDhJ7aBl89NbEuprS.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7f4121fa6b81e29d169874","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1783272,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Mira Filzah","original_name":"Mira Filzah","